  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Emergency life-saving Health, Nutrition, WASH and Protection support for vulnerable populations in South Central Somalia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme is designed to meet urgent needs of internally displaced persons (IDPs) and host communities through mobile outreach clinics, facility-based services at Qansaxley Health Centre in Dollow, and community-level interventions delivered by trained Community Health Workers (CHWs).</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tr&#xf3;caire&#x2019;s proposed humanitarian response aims to deliver integrated emergency interventions across Health, Nutrition, WASH, and Protection sectors in Gedo Region.</narrative>
  </description>
